            "section_title": "1. The `isCLIOnly()` Security Guard",
            "anchor": "1-the-isclionly-security-guard",
            "text": "SPP enforces strict CLI SAPI guarding. Any command executing system operations or file modifications must override:\n\n```php\npublic function isCLIOnly(): bool\n{\n    return true;\n}\n```\n\nWhen `CommandManager::execute()` runs, it checks `PHP_SAPI !== 'cli'`. If accessed over HTTP, execution terminates immediately with a security block.",
